			"notes": "# First release of Wano's economy mod.\n## New features such as:\n* Rewritten to no longer depend on the architectuary mod, meaning that all you need is just the mod loader and the mod itself.\n* in game trading through inventories seamlessly with the exchange of cash as a additional feature.\n* Auctioning your inventory to the entire server in exchange for money. With all auctions being publicly available.\n\n## Upcoming features in the future\n* Proper filtering for history\n* Multiple auctioneers in one auction support"
		}
